  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-session-share",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\n> Share complete Session trees as local, offline Capsules between DeepSeek Harness installations."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-session-share\n```\n\nBoth the sender and the recipient need to install this plugin in their own Harness."
    },
    {
      "section": "Share a Session",
      "text": "This plugin lets you share your own Session with another person. It exports the current Session, its complete subagent tree, and referenced images into a local offline Capsule (`.dsh-session-share.zip`). You can send that file through chat, file transfer, or another trusted channel.\n\n1. Open the Session you want to share.\n2. Select **Share** in the Session header, or run `/share-session`.\n3. Select **Download Capsule** in the dialog and save the ZIP file.\n4. Send the ZIP file to the recipient."
    },
    {
      "section": "Import a Session",
      "text": "After receiving the Capsule:\n\n1. Run `/import-session` to open the import dialog. The current Harness does not expose an **Import Session** item in the sidebar.\n2. Choose the local destination workspace.\n3. Drop the Capsule ZIP into the dialog, or choose it from your device.\n4. After a successful import, the browser reloads and opens the imported root Session."
    },
    {
      "section": "Import a Session",
      "text": "The imported Session stays idle until the recipient sends a new message. It then uses the receiving Harness's model, agent composition, credentials, tools, and workspace; the sender's execution environment is not reused directly."
    },
    {
      "section": "Import behavior",
      "text": "- Every import creates a new local Session tree with new local IDs.\n- Importing the same Capsule again creates another independent copy instead of reusing the original.\n- Capsules are offline files, not online share links; the plugin never uploads Session contents automatically."
    },
    {
      "section": "Privacy and security",
      "text": "Capsules can contain prompts, model replies, tool input/output, Workspace paths, and images. Share them only with trusted recipients and review the contents for sensitive information first.\n\nSession Capsule v1 provides no encryption, redaction, access control, or online revocation."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-session-share",
      "text": "[English](README.md) | 中文\n\n> 在不同的 DeepSeek Harness 之间，以本地离线会话包的形式分享完整 Session 树。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-session-share\n```\n\n发送方和接收方都需要在自己的 Harness 中安装这个插件。"
    },
    {
      "section": "分享会话",
      "text": "这个插件用于把自己的 Session 分享给其他人。它会将当前 Session、完整的子会话树以及引用的图片导出为一个本地离线会话包（`.dsh-session-share.zip`），你可以通过聊天工具、文件传输或其他可信方式把这个文件发送给对方。\n\n1. 打开要分享的 Session。\n2. 点击 Session Header 中的 **Share**，或执行 `/share-session`。\n3. 在弹窗中点击 **下载会话包**，保存生成的 ZIP 文件。\n4. 将 ZIP 文件发送给接收方。"
    },
    {
      "section": "导入会话",
      "text": "接收方拿到会话包后：\n\n1. 执行 `/import-session` 打开导入弹窗。当前 Harness 没有侧边栏中的 **Import Session** 入口。\n2. 选择要导入的本地目标工作区。\n3. 将会话包 ZIP 拖入弹窗，或点击选择文件。\n4. 导入成功后浏览器会刷新并打开导入的根会话。\n\n导入的会话默认处于等待状态。接收方发送新消息后，它才会使用接收方 Harness 的模型、Agent 配置、凭证、工具和工作区继续运行；发送方的执行环境不会被直接复用。"
    },
    {
      "section": "导入行为",
      "text": "- 每次导入都会创建全新的本地 Session 树，并生成新的本地 ID。\n- 重复导入同一个会话包会产生第二份独立副本，而不是复用原会话。\n- 会话包是离线文件，不是在线分享链接；插件不会自动上传会话内容。"
    },
    {
      "section": "隐私与安全",
      "text": "会话包可能包含提示词、模型回复、工具输入输出、Workspace 路径和图片。请只发送给可信的接收方，并在分享前确认内容中没有敏感信息。\n\nSession Capsule v1 不提供加密、内容脱敏、权限控制或在线撤回能力。"
    }
  ],
